'''Ice warriors''' are mid-level ice elementals.{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote=Ice Warriors are a kind of ice elemental, shatter them with blunt weapons or melt them with fire.|loc=|notes=|name=}} They have a 100% [[elemental weakness]] to [[fire spells]]. Ice warriors can be assigned by [[Krystilia]] for a [[Wilderness]] [[Slayer task]], or by [[Vannaka]] or [[Mazchna]] for normal tasks.

[[Kamil]] fought during [[Desert Treasure I]] is considered an ice warrior for a Slayer assignment.

